{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-a2s-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn A2S Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Uwell Caliburn A2S Pod System, featuring an integrated 520mAh battery, 2mL side-filled pod capacity, and integrated 1.2ohm meshed coil. Cross-compatible with the original Caliburn A2 Pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-a2s-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn A2S Replacement Pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn A2S Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Caliburn A2S infographic\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0683\/3504\/2878\/files\/Uwell_Calibrun_A2S_Pod_Systes_-_Infographic_-min.jpg?v=1669758838\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable aluminum-alloy, the chassis of the Caliburn A2S Pod System delivers a highly portable form-factor that can easily be stored within the pocket, purse, or bookbag. Equipped with a 2mL pod, the Caliburn A2S refills via a silicone stoppered side fill system. Within the clear pod is an integrated 1.2ohm coil that delivers amazing flavor and vapor that will excite the taste buds, all from your favorite eJuice or nicotine salts. Operating off a draw-activated firing mechanism, the Caliburn A2S is your next best vaping experience, packed into a powerful compact vape.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell CALIBURN A2S Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 110.1mm by 21.3mm by 11.7mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 520mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax Wattage Output: 15W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eJuice Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1.2ohm A2S Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with 0.9ohm A2 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn A2S Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 1.2ohm Caliburn A2S Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531626946615,"sku":"U Cali A2S Pod System","price":3400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_caliburn_a2s_-_pod_system_-_black.png?v=1741703122","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-a2s-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




